      "schema:description": "'HHCPO' is the owner's term, registered as a search string on 2026-11-11 by owner direction (ISS-20261111-TAX-040). Its chemical identity is UNCONFIRMED: the repository records no verified chemical name, structure, chemical class, natural occurrence, route/origin, synonym relation or regulatory status for this term, and no external identifier (CAS, ChEBI, Wikidata, PubChem) was verified - none is recorded here and none may be inferred from the query string. The term sits in compound_identity_unverified, an administrative registration-state category, so this placement asserts no route or chemical classification. Whether this term denotes an acetate/ester form of another cannabinoid or an unrelated substance is not recorded and is not inferred; no relationship to any other concept is asserted. Evidence that would move the term out of this category: a documented chemical name with a verified external identifier, or a recorded source naming the substance and its route/origin; the basis belongs in docs/provenance/compound-taxonomy.md.",
